"cpc" = (
/obj/structure/table/steel,
/obj/item/paper{
	info = "Hey Frank, sorry that you have to perform the maintenance here in this next cycle. But at least this means the guys up top trust you, right? The AIC substation isn't pretty and honestly they could have done a better job routing the cabling but it's workable. There are spare cells for the PSU's in those crates. Remember the power goes in at the terminal with the Red Cables and goes out to its bump through the green cables. I'm sure you'll be fine and everything will be working but with all of this weather recently I wouldn't be surprised if something rusted off and sparked one of the cables. Good luck! Oh by the way, if you need to repair the secure conduit wire since it shorts out all the time the ladder just due north of here leads to the external catwalk, ride it down and go left, the access path is just south-west from there, though you'll probably have to get someone from admin to lift its lockdown."
	},
/obj/effect/turf_decal/tile/dark/opposingcorners,
/turf/open/floor/tiled/dark/small,
/area/site104/aihousing/substation)
